# Summary

The charter states: Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-f10f5076361a859ea3ab6eb8a505adcb38ae6860 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex states the ordinary contribution amount: [[cite:obs-d8daf3d398fd748febc736de2e3219b4509ba3f5 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]